# Extraction and LVS products. Regenerate with `make drc lvs`; the layout they
# describe is itself regenerated by `make layout`.
*.ext
*.res.ext
*.nodes
*.spc
inv_magic.spice
inv.magic.lvs/
comp.out
netgen.log
*.lvs.report
*.pex.spice
*.pex.log

# The layout regenerates bit-identically from gen_inv.tcl, so the generator is
# the only source of truth for it. A committed copy could fall behind an edited
# generator and still pass every check, which is the one state worth making
# unrepresentable. All three rebuild together; none is committed.
inv.mag
sky130_fd_pr__*fet_01v8_*.mag
